<title>HUNGARY: TENNIS-BUDAPEST WOMEN'S OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BUDAPEST WOMEN'S OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the</p>
<p>$107,500 Budapest Women's Open tennis tournament on Wednesday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Manon Maruska (Austria)</p>
<p>6-0 6-4</p>
<p>Joanette Kruger (South Africa) beat 3-Ruxandra Dragomir</p>
<p>(Romania)</p>
<p>6-3 7-5</p>
<p>4-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Natalie Dechy (France) 6-1</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>1-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat Petra Begerow (Germany) 1-6</p>
<p>6-2 6-2</p>
<p>7-Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia) beat Gala Leon Garcia (Spain) 6-2</p>
<p>1-6 6-4</p>
</text>
